# OBSOLETE AND INTENTIONALLY NON-INSTALLABLE AS A DROP-IN.
#
# systemd dependency lists such as Requires= cannot be reset from a drop-in.
# Installing this historical override shape would therefore leave an old Phase 2
# Requires=postgresql@16-main.service dependency able to pull PostgreSQL up.
# Install the reviewed full replacement instead:
#   /etc/systemd/system/uten-pgbackup.service
# from:
#   deploy/systemd/uten-pgbackup.service.example
